// Shared Syncthing ignore patterns for the workspace folder.
//
// Only .stfolder, .stignore and .stversions are reserved, so this name syncs
// like any other file -- unlike .stignore itself, which Syncthing never syncs
// and which therefore drifts per device. Every device's .stignore is just
// "#include .stignore.shared", so editing the patterns here reaches all of them.
//
// see also https://forum.syncthing.net/t/useful-stignore-patterns/1175

!zsh_history

.direnv/
.terraform/
.cache/
.venv/
temp/
sessions/
node_modules/

// git worktrees are machine-local: their gitdir pointers are absolute, and the
// workspace root differs per OS (/data on linux, /Users/Shared/data on darwin),
// so a synced gitdir would need two different values at once.
.worktrees/
**/.git/worktrees/

(?d)__pycache__
(?d).DS_Store
(?d).ansible/
*.log
maintenance.lock
